BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_315506181@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042005Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday- Asheville Pizza and Brew North Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nIt's time to venture back to the North coun
 try so to speak. This route has a few hills. The beauty of this run is tha
 t there is pretty decent food and if you're feeling saucy you can catch a 
 movie after the run.\n\nWe'll meet out front. Bring your plucky spirit and
  sense of adventure!\n\nMile 3:down merrimon toward downtown\, right onto 
 weaver blvd\, right onto broadway\, right onto campus drive\, left onto un
 iversity heights. Follow onto edgewood rd. make left onto merrimon and bac
 k to ABC.\n\nMile 5/6: follow Edgewood past merrimon and make right onto K
 imberly. Follow Kimberly onto Edwin place. Left onto Charlotte st. Left on
 to Evelyn place. Right back on Kimberly. Left back on Edgewood. Right onto
  long st. Left onto e. larchmont.left on merrimon and back to ABC.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/315506181/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260701T224107Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260701T224107Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_314753191@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042005Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260723T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260723T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/314753191/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260512T140551Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T140551Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
